      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hypothetically if we are blurring `kUnpremul`, we don\u0027t want to set this to `kPremul`, we should keep the original alpha type. I think we only want to change the alpha type if it is `kOpaque`.\n\n```\nSkImageInfo dstII \u003d src.info().makeWH(dstBounds.width(), dstBounds.height());\nif (dstII.alphaType() \u003d\u003d kOpaque_SkAlphaType) {\n    dstII \u003d dstII.makeAlphaType(kPremul_SkAlphaType);\n}\nif (!dst.tryAllocPixels(dstII)) { }\n```",
