      "writtenOn": "2026-10-23T14:51:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want to do that; blurring an unpremul or premul image is not expected to be identical to each other. It\u0027s essentially the same expected differences for interpolating a gradient in premul or unpremul colors. They will give different answers and that\u0027s ok, particularly around how they blend against transparent black.",
